<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body>
    <table style="width: 100%; float: left; border: 5px solid #0000000d; padding: 0px 10px;" border="0">
      
      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_HEADER}}" style="width: 100%;" />
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <p>Dear {{name}},</p>

          <p>
            We understand that because of salary and job issues you have not been able to repay your amount which is long overdue. We would like to come and meet you and discuss the problem with you.
          </p>

          <p>
            So request you to indicate a convenient time when we can come and meet you.
          </p>

          <p>
            We want to meet you in order to understand your problem and find a solution. Also we want to discuss the situation and collect payment which can be made by online link or paid in cash against authorized receipts.
          </p>

          <p>
            Looking forward to hearing from you asap.
          </p>

          <p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>

          <p>Best regards,</p>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_FOOTER}}" style="width: 100%;" />
        </td>
      </tr>

    </table>
  </body>
</html>
